君に ちゃんと 届くように
so that it properly reaches you.

287
00:42:59,914 --> 00:43:05,564
こんこよアイランド楽しんでる？最後はライブステージを楽しんでいってね！
Are you enjoying Konkoyo Island? Enjoy the final live stage to the fullest!

288
00:43:09,564 --> 00:43:12,564
止まったままの
The time that stayed stopped

289
00:43:12,564 --> 00:43:15,864
公認 すれ違う気持ち
and our officially crossing feelings...

290
00:43:15,864 --> 00:43:21,564
君のその心が溶かしていく
are melting your heart away.

291
00:43:21,564 --> 00:43:27,014
特別な形は 消えない軌跡描く
Special forms draw an indelible trajectory.

292
00:43:27,014 --> 00:43:35,864
これからも ずっと 変わらないで
From now on, forever, don't change.

293
00:43:36,064 --> 00:43:41,864
大好きって気持ちは 回って 回って 増えてく
The feeling of "I love you" goes around and around, multiplying.

294
00:43:41,864 --> 00:43:47,864
大切なんだ 全部 一つ一つ抱きしめて
They are all so precious; I want to embrace them one by one.

295
00:43:47,864 --> 00:43:53,864
君の間だけは 過去を全部 踏みしめていこう
Only for you, let's step firmly through all the past.

296
00:43:54,064 --> 00:44:01,064
溢れて 止まらない 君に ちゃんと 届くように
Overflowing and unstopping, so that it properly reaches you.

297
00:44:06,064 --> 00:44:11,864
別れあっても どれも ズレない気持ち
Even if we part ways, none of our feelings are out of sync.

298
00:44:11,864 --> 00:44:17,864
何が大切だって 気づいていく
We realize what truly matters.

299
00:44:17,864 --> 00:44:24,064
切り替わった 形は 永遠の奇跡紡ぐ
The form that changed spins an eternal miracle.

300
00:44:24,064 --> 00:44:31,064
まっすぐな 君に 光り続けていく
Shining straight onto you, continuing to glow.

301
00:44:31,064 --> 00:44:37,064
大好きって言えたら もっと もっと 高鳴る
If I could say "I love you", my heart would beat even faster.

302
00:44:37,064 --> 00:44:43,064
会いたいんだ 今すぐ はやる気持ち駆け出して
I want to see you right now, my eager feelings running forth.

303
00:44:44,064 --> 00:44:50,064
ちょっと待って 止まらない 胸のドキドキしてる
Wait a second, my heart won't stop pounding.

304
00:44:50,064 --> 00:44:57,064
一瞬も忘れない あの日も 夢に見る
I won't forget even a single moment; I see those days in my dreams too.

305
00:44:57,064 --> 00:45:00,136
たくさん...
So many...

306
00:45:00,145 --> 00:45:02,225
みんな同じ想いが重なって
Everyone's same feelings overlap,

307
00:45:02,225 --> 00:45:05,065
それぞれに歩き出した未来でも
...even on the futures each of us started walking towards.

308
00:45:05,225 --> 00:45:10,945
みんな同じ想いが変わらずに続いていくよ
Everyone's same feelings will continue unchanged.

309
00:45:23,825 --> 00:45:29,485
大好きって気持ちは 気持ちは
The feeling of 'I love you,' the feeling...

310
00:45:29,905 --> 00:45:34,665
絶対消したくない だって全部私でしょ
...I never want to erase it, because it's all me, right?

311
00:45:35,925 --> 00:45:41,345
大好きって気持ちは もっと もっと増えてく
The feeling of 'I love you' grows more and more.

312
00:45:41,745 --> 00:45:46,925
大切なんだ全部 一つ一つ抱きしめて
Everything is precious, holding each one close.

313
00:45:47,385 --> 00:45:53,005
ねえ一度会えたんだってほら心を分にして行こう
Hey, we met once, see, let's make our hearts one and go.

314
00:45:53,405 --> 00:46:00,305
溢れて止まらない 君にちゃんと届くように
Overflowing and won't stop, so it reaches you properly.

315
00:46:23,022 --> 00:46:29,272
さあ 夢を叶えるのはみんなの勇気
Now, making dreams come true takes everyone's courage...

316
00:46:29,422 --> 00:46:37,072
負けない心で明日へかけていこう
...running toward tomorrow with an unbeatable heart!

317
00:46:34,872 --> 00:46:37,872
[Title: それは僕たちの奇跡]
[Title: Sore wa Bokutachi no Kiseki]

318
00:46:44,272 --> 00:46:51,372
強い強い願い事が僕たちを導いてくれた
Strong, strong wishes guided us along the way.

319
00:46:54,872 --> 00:47:03,772
次は絶対譲れないよ残された時間を握りしめて
Next time, I will never give in, holding tight to the time we have left.

320
00:47:05,772 --> 00:47:13,772
ただの思い出 それだけじゃいやだよ精一杯の力の限り走り出すんだ
Just memories aren't enough, running as fast as all our strength allows!

321
00:47:17,072 --> 00:47:19,072
Chance for me! Chance for you!

322
00:47:19,872 --> 00:47:29,572
さあ 夢を抱きしめたら上を向いて君の世界が大きく変わるよ
Now, if you hold your dream close and look up, your world will change greatly!

323
00:47:30,872 --> 00:47:41,572
さあ 夢を叶えるのはみんなの勇気 負けない心で明日へかけていこう
Now, making dreams come true takes everyone's courage, running toward tomorrow with an unbeatable heart!

324
00:47:51,072 --> 00:48:00,572
熱い熱い期待の中で僕たちは喜びを歌う
Amidst burning, burning expectations, we sing songs of joy.

325
00:48:01,872 --> 00:48:10,572
同じ想い感じてみよう 限られた時間を楽しもうよ
Let's feel the same feelings, let's enjoy the limited time we have!

326
00:48:12,072 --> 00:48:22,272
もう止められない 情熱の価値だね 悔やむより走り続けよう
We can't stop anymore, this is the value of passion, let's keep running rather than regretting!

327
00:48:22,872 --> 00:48:32,072
不意に見た空 こんなにも青いよ 大丈夫 諦めないで走るんだ
The sky seen unexpectedly is so blue, it's alright, don't give up, keep running!

328
00:48:33,872 --> 00:48:36,872
Dance for me! Dance with you!

329
00:48:37,072 --> 00:48:47,072
そう あの日夢見たのはみんなの笑顔 君の笑顔だから笑ってよ
Yes, what we dreamed of that day was everyone's smiles, because it's your smile, so smile!

330
00:48:47,872 --> 00:48:56,572
そう あの日同じ夢を描いたんだ 輝く瞳は明日を信じていた
Yes, we envisioned the same dream that day, shining eyes believed in tomorrow.

331
00:49:01,872 --> 00:49:12,572
さあ 最後まで駆け抜けるよ
Now, running through to the very end!

332
00:49:29,872 --> 00:49:40,072
さあ 夢を抱きしめたら上を向いて君の世界が大きく変わるよ
Now, if you hold your dream close and look up, your world will change greatly!

333
00:49:40,872 --> 00:49:51,572
さあ 夢を叶えるのはみんなの勇気 負けない心で明日へかけていこう
Now, making dreams come true takes everyone's courage, running toward tomorrow with an unbeatable heart!

334
00:49:51,872 --> 00:50:00,072
そう あの日夢見たのはみんなの笑顔 君の笑顔だから
Yes, what we dreamed of that day was everyone's smiles, because it's your smile...

335
00:50:37,411 --> 00:50:41,331
ねえねえ 今度のアイランドは楽しんでもらえた？
Hey hey, did you enjoy this island?

336
00:50:41,811 --> 00:50:46,411
今日この日にこの島に流れ着いた君は運がいい！
You're so lucky to have washed ashore on this island today!

337
00:50:46,691 --> 00:50:51,091
実は出来立てほやほやのオリジナル曲があるんだよ！
Actually, I have a brand-new original song for you!

338
00:50:51,391 --> 00:50:55,851
新オリジナル曲「New Journey」、聴いてね！
Listen to my new original song, 'New Journey'!

339
00:51:03,170 --> 00:51:06,730
素敵だね ひとりじゃない
It's wonderful, you're not alone

340
00:51:07,210 --> 00:51:11,610
新しい旅
On this new journey...

341
00:51:27,830 --> 00:51:30,410
何を求められてるの？
What is being asked of me?

342
00:51:31,010 --> 00:51:33,870
矛盾だらけの世界で
In this world full of contradictions

343
00:51:34,330 --> 00:51:37,270
何を信じればいいのか
What should I believe in

344
00:51:37,610 --> 00:51:40,530
彷徨い歩いてた
As I wandered about?

345
00:51:41,530 --> 00:51:44,410
どんな夢でもいいから
No matter what kind of dream it is

346
00:51:44,830 --> 00:51:47,870
長い道のりを進もう
Let's press on down this long road

347
00:51:48,410 --> 00:51:53,410
困難が待ち受けていても 仲間と乗り越えよう
Even if hardships await, let's overcome them together

348
00:51:54,050 --> 00:52:01,450
ひとりで迷い続けていた日々を
The days I spent wandering alone...

349
00:52:01,770 --> 00:52:07,330
震えないでチカラ強く止めてみせるよ
I'll stop them firmly without trembling

350
00:52:08,050 --> 00:52:12,410
初めて正義を共にかざせば
When we raise our righteousness together for the first time

351
00:52:12,830 --> 00:52:22,010
思い通りの光が真っ直ぐに飛び出してゆく
The light we envisioned shoots straight forward

352
00:52:22,450 --> 00:52:29,150
忘れないでね この眩しさを 希望に満ちた輝き
Don't forget this dazzling radiance, this brilliance filled with hope

353
00:52:29,650 --> 00:52:37,410
追いかけて あり得ない景色に 辿り着きましょう
Let's chase it and reach an impossible scenery

354
00:52:44,230 --> 00:52:46,930
答え探しはいつでも
Searching for answers will always

355
00:52:47,330 --> 00:52:50,150
ぼくらを困らせるけど
Cause us trouble, but

356
00:52:50,630 --> 00:52:53,430
戸惑いなんていらない
We don't need any hesitation

357
00:52:53,830 --> 00:52:56,730
今日から歩き出そう
Let's start walking from today

358
00:52:57,570 --> 00:53:00,430
汚れた空は綺麗に
The tainted sky becomes clear

359
00:53:00,810 --> 00:53:04,030
冷たい雨は消え去る
And the cold rain fades away

360
00:53:04,430 --> 00:53:10,030
切ない夜が明ければ 風向き変わりだす
When the bittersweet night breaks, the wind begins to change

361
00:53:11,070 --> 00:53:17,150
大きな雲を動かし 立ち上がり
Moving the massive clouds, standing up

362
00:53:17,550 --> 00:53:23,850
両手広げ 走り出そう 扉を開けて
Opening our arms, let's run forth, opening the door

363
00:53:24,270 --> 00:53:32,490
壊れた夢は拾い集めて 並べ替えればいいから
We can just gather our broken dreams and rearrange them

364
00:53:33,530 --> 00:53:41,410
完璧を求めなくても 追い詰められて悲しくても
Even without seeking perfection, even when cornered and sad

365
00:53:41,950 --> 00:53:45,390
諦めないで続けよう
Let's keep going without giving up

366
00:53:45,790 --> 00:53:53,470
白い月 愛しい星たちも ぼくらを照らす
The white moon and beloved stars illuminate us as well

367
00:54:22,630 --> 00:54:26,650
初めて正義を共にかざせば
When we raise our righteousness together for the first time

368
00:54:27,050 --> 00:54:36,270
思い通りの光が真っ直ぐに飛び出してゆく
The light we envisioned shoots straight forward

369
00:54:36,650 --> 00:54:43,390
忘れないでね この眩しさを 希望に満ちた輝き
Don't forget this dazzling radiance, this brilliance filled with hope

370
00:54:43,870 --> 00:54:51,730
追いかけて あり得ない景色に 辿り着きましょう
Let's chase it and reach an impossible scenery

371
00:55:15,608 --> 00:55:25,548
みんな、今日はこんこよアイランドに遊びに来てくれて、ありがとうございます！こんこのあとはお土産をゲットだということで、大切なお知らせです！
Everyone, thank you so much for coming to play on Konkoyo Island today! After the stream, it's time to get some souvenirs, so I have some important announcements!

372
00:55:26,188 --> 00:55:48,648
まず、今歌った新しいオリジナル曲「New Journey」はこのあと24時から販売開始！水七瀬さんの曲をはじめ、たくさんのアニソンを手がけて来られた矢吹俊郎さん、大平勉さんに作っていただいた、アニメ「白衣こよりのオープニングテーマ」みたいなかっこいい曲です！ゲットしてヘビロテしてね！そして、このあとすぐ！
First off, my new original song "New Journey" that I just sang will go on sale tonight at midnight! Composed by Toshiro Yabuki and Tsutomu Ohira—who have worked on Nana Mizuki's songs and many other anime songs—it's a cool song that feels like the opening theme to an anime called "Hakui Koyori"! Be sure to grab it and put it on repeat! And coming up right after this...

373
00:55:50,408 --> 00:56:03,088
こよが作詞したオリジナル曲「Tear-Gazer」のアニメーションMVがプレミア公開されます！初めてのアニメーションMV、絶対見てね！
The animated music video for my original song "Tear-Gazer," with lyrics written by me, will premiere! It's my very first animated music video, so make sure to check it out!

374
00:56:04,028 --> 00:56:12,688
続いて、こんこよアイランドの観光お土産、お待たせのグッズ紹介です！今回は海のレジャーセット！
Next up is the introduction of our Konkoyo Island tourist souvenirs and merchandise you've all been waiting for! This time, it's a marine leisure set!

375
00:56:13,448 --> 00:56:18,928
アイランドでの海の思い出を飾ろう！ももこママ描き下ろしの水着タペストリー！
Display your ocean memories from the island! A swimsuit tapestry illustrated by Momoko-mama!

376
00:56:22,108 --> 00:56:25,988
タペストリーを見ながら聞くのにぴったり！「いっしょに海で大はしゃぎボイス」も発売するよ！
Perfect to listen to while looking at the tapestry! We're also releasing the "Let's Go Wild at the Beach Together" voice pack!

377
00:56:27,208 --> 00:56:35,888
海といえばキンキンに冷えた飲み物だよね！こよとお揃いタンブラー！思い出を眺めながら美味しい飲み物を飲んでね！
When you think of the ocean, you think of ice-cold drinks! A matching tumbler with Koyori! Enjoy a delicious drink while gazing at your memories!

378
00:56:36,228 --> 00:56:45,408
そして、お出かけする時もいつも一緒！使いやすすぎるショルダーバッグ！チャームや裏地もめっちゃ良いから要チェックだ！
And for when you're out and about, always be together! An ultra-convenient shoulder bag! The charm and inner lining are super nice, so definitely check it out!

379
00:56:46,448 --> 00:57:00,688
そしてバッグにつけてお出かけしてね！こよの水着パーカー衣装のぬいぐるみキーホルダーだ！フードの脱ぎ着ができる上に、中にはちゃんと水着を着てるんだよ！のぞき込みなんてエッチ！
And attach it to your bag when you head out! It's a plush keychain of Koyori in her swimsuit hoodie outfit! The hood is removable, and she's actually wearing a swimsuit underneath! Peeking inside is perverted!

380
00:57:01,168 --> 00:57:11,868
気になる全部セットには、去年大好評だったこよが助手くんの誕生日をお祝いするASMRボイスの2024年海バージョンがついてくる！
The complete set includes the 2024 ocean version of the ASMR voice celebrating Assistants' birthdays, which was a huge hit last year!

381
00:57:12,848 --> 00:57:29,888
さらに！直筆サインと複製メッセージ入りポストカードも！今回は全員直筆かくよ！戦争を終わらせにきた！全員にかける機会はなかなかないと思うので、この機会にぜひ手に入れてくれたら嬉しいな！
Furthermore! A postcard with a handwritten signature and duplicated message! This time, I'll be handwriting every single one! I've come to end the war! I don't think there are many opportunities to write for everyone, so I'd be super happy if you could grab one this time!

382
00:57:30,308 --> 00:57:39,208
以上、こんこよアイランドのお土産、こよの2024誕生日記念グッズのお知らせでした！
That concludes the announcement for the Konkoyo Island souvenirs and Koyori's 2024 birthday commemorative goods!

383
00:57:41,888 --> 00:57:55,888
こんこよアイランド、なかなか楽しい島だったなぁ。そんなことを思いながら、君たちは目的の島、ホロライブアイランドへ向かうのであった。
Konkoyo Island was quite a fun island. With such thoughts in mind, you headed toward your destination, Hololive Island.

